{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01332",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.64,
      "end_seconds": 3.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "sorry I'm a little late, doctor"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 4.53,
      "end_seconds": 8.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "Of course, leave it there. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 9.53,
      "end_seconds": 23.9,
      "duration_seconds": 14.37,
      "text": "Good afternoon, doctor. I look after them so I thought I'd come. It's pain in my lower back, doctor. She didn't want to come, but I insisted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 25.72,
      "end_seconds": 29.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "what's the the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 30.88,
      "end_seconds": 34.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "Mm, about about a month, give or take."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 36.73,
      "end_seconds": 41.47,
      "duration_seconds": 4.74,
      "text": "I think it's been nearer about two months, actually"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 42.52,
      "end_seconds": 47.37,
      "duration_seconds": 4.85,
      "text": "Okay, so roughly one to two months. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 48.51,
      "end_seconds": 50.48,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "I suppose so, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 51.91,
      "end_seconds": 55.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "Would you say mild, moderate or severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 56.57,
      "end_seconds": 59.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "um, I'd call it severe"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.61,
      "end_seconds": 64.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "Any other symptoms with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 65.15,
      "end_seconds": 73.97,
      "duration_seconds": 8.82,
      "text": "A stooped back goes along with it, most of the time. The stooped back? That's been for six months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.62,
      "end_seconds": 88.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "So, I'll just record a few vital signs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.7,
      "end_seconds": 103.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "Bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.19,
      "end_seconds": 126.65,
      "duration_seconds": 7.46,
      "text": "Okay: pulse is 67 beats a minute, respiratory rate 14, pressure 122 over 79. And temperature 36.9."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 128.89,
      "end_seconds": 133.04,
      "duration_seconds": 4.15,
      "text": "So, could you come over to the couch, please?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 134.98,
      "end_seconds": 135.89,
      "duration_seconds": 0.91,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 137.65,
      "end_seconds": 139.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "Raise your arm for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 153.35,
      "end_seconds": 159.86,
      "duration_seconds": 6.51,
      "text": "there is tenderness over the mid lower spine and no weakness in the legs"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.59,
      "end_seconds": 173.03,
      "duration_seconds": 8.44,
      "text": "Thank you, you can get dressed. Have you had any chest pain or numbness in the legs?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 173.79,
      "end_seconds": 179.03,
      "duration_seconds": 5.24,
      "text": "No chest pain or numbness in the legs, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 182.77,
      "end_seconds": 186.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.98,
      "text": "Have you noticed fever, night pain or weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 188.18,
      "end_seconds": 190.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "nope, nothing like that"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 191.4,
      "end_seconds": 193.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "Is your chest okay generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 194.56,
      "end_seconds": 195.57,
      "duration_seconds": 1.01,
      "text": "breathing's normal"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.85,
      "end_seconds": 199.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "is your urine normal, no changes?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 205.73,
      "end_seconds": 208.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "that's normal as far as I know"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 214.28,
      "end_seconds": 216.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "Have you had any surgical procedures?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 218.18,
      "end_seconds": 224.33,
      "duration_seconds": 6.15,
      "text": "Yes, I had a mole taken off my arm, a few years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.55,
      "end_seconds": 227.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "do you live by yourself?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 228.48,
      "end_seconds": 233.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.55,
      "text": "No, I share a house with my brother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.8,
      "end_seconds": 236.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "Okay, how active are you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 236.63,
      "end_seconds": 240.38,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "I hardly move around during the day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.21,
      "end_seconds": 245.46,
      "duration_seconds": 4.25,
      "text": "Can you list what you take, tablets, creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 249.03,
      "end_seconds": 251.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "I take alendronate, once a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.81,
      "end_seconds": 257.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "How much do you take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 260.54,
      "end_seconds": 261.49,
      "duration_seconds": 0.95,
      "text": "70 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.94,
      "end_seconds": 262.78,
      "duration_seconds": 0.84,
      "text": "mm-hmm"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 280.76,
      "end_seconds": 285.81,
      "duration_seconds": 5.05,
      "text": "Any allergies to tablets, food or anything in the the environment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 287.68,
      "end_seconds": 292.87,
      "duration_seconds": 5.19,
      "text": "I'm allergic to nickel, I get a rash on my skin."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 305.76,
      "end_seconds": 308.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "do you have any chronic illnesses?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 309.56,
      "end_seconds": 311.27,
      "duration_seconds": 1.71,
      "text": "yes, thin bones"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 311.78,
      "end_seconds": 346.71,
      "duration_seconds": 34.93,
      "text": "Understood. Let me tell you where I've got to. It points towards thin bones with a fragility fracture and back pain. I'd like to arrange a spine X-ray for back pain. Take the weekly tablet first thing with a full glass of water and stay upright for half an hour. We'll refer you to the falls clinic. I'm not ordering a bone density scan today. If things carry on next month, we'll consider it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 348.49,
      "end_seconds": 357.22,
      "duration_seconds": 8.73,
      "text": "I'd like to see you again in six weeks right, that's the plan do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 358.12,
      "end_seconds": 361.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "Right, I'll do that. Thank you, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 363.07,
      "end_seconds": 364.63,
      "duration_seconds": 1.56,
      "text": "Have a good day."
    }
  ]
}